<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{syncText}}" class="notice sync-status">{{syncText}} · 在家庭页可手动刷新</view>
  <view class="heading"
    ><view
      ><text class="title">采购清单</text
      ><text class="caption">按用餐人数汇总，准备一周好味道。</text></view
    ><t-icon name="cart" size="48rpx" color="#7f956a"
  /></view>
  <view class="week-navigation"
    ><t-button
      size="small"
      variant="text"
      icon="chevron-left"
      bind:tap="previous"
      disabled="{{offset === -520}}" /><text>{{label}}</text
    ><t-button
      size="small"
      variant="text"
      icon="chevron-right"
      bind:tap="next"
      disabled="{{offset === 520}}"
  /></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning">{{error}}</view>
  <block wx:elif="{{total}}">
    <view class="shopping-progress"
      ><view class="shopping-count"
        ><text>已备齐</text><text class="progress-number">{{completed}}</text
        ><text>/ {{total}} 种</text></view
      ><t-button
        size="small"
        variant="text"
        disabled="{{!completed}}"
        bind:tap="clear"
        >取消勾选</t-button
      ></view
    >
    <view class="card shopping-card"
      ><view class="list-heading">重量清单 · 克</view
      ><text wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty-line"
        >当前全部食材需先核对原单位。</text
      ><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="key" class="shopping-row"
        ><t-checkbox
          checked="{{item.checked}}"
          label="{{item.name}}"
          content="{{item.amountText}} {{item.unit}}"
          icon="rectangle"
          data-key="{{item.key}}"
          bind:change="toggle" /></view
    ></view>
    <view wx:if="{{pendingItems.length}}" class="card shopping-card"
      ><view class="list-heading pending-heading">原单位清单 · 待称重核对</view
      ><view class="notice"
        >以下记录未换算成克，请按原单位采购，或在私人菜谱里称重核对。</view
      ><view wx:for="{{pendingItems}}" wx:key="key" class="shopping-row"
        ><t-checkbox
          checked="{{item.checked}}"
          label="{{item.name}}"
          content="{{item.amountText}} {{item.unit}} · 待核对"
          icon="rectangle"
          data-key="{{item.key}}"
          bind:change="toggle" /></view
    ></view>
    <view class="actions"
      ><t-button theme="primary" block icon="file-copy" bind:tap="copy"
        >复制采购清单</t-button
      ><t-button variant="outline" theme="primary" bind:tap="week"
        >调整菜单</t-button
      ></view
    >
  </block>
  <view wx:else class="empty"
    ><t-icon name="cart" size="76rpx" color="#8ca276" /><text
      >一周的美味，从点菜开始</text
    ><text class="caption">安排菜单后，这里会自动汇总食材。</text
    ><t-button theme="primary" bind:tap="week">去点菜</t-button></view
  >
  <text class="page-note"
    >仅合并同名同维度的食材。千克可换算为克；个、颗、毫升等不会自动变成克。</text
  >
</view>
